00:26:57.650 --> 00:27:00.893
The nucleotides have a
match with each other.

00:27:02.352 --> 00:27:06.620
If we imagine stretching
that out and flattening it,

00:27:06.620 --> 00:27:08.770
you can end up with this

00:27:10.040 --> 00:27:14.110
where the gray is a phosphate backbone,

00:27:14.110 --> 00:27:17.780
it's the back part of the
DNA, a negative charge.

00:27:17.780 --> 00:27:20.693
And then these are individual nucleotides.

00:27:22.060 --> 00:27:24.390
