They have some of those monkeys that glow,

00:48:04.610 --> 00:48:06.313
which is wild, but so cool.

00:48:08.170 --> 00:48:10.210
Another thing you can use PCR for

00:48:10.210 --> 00:48:13.610
is like kind of outside
of the realm of research

00:48:13.610 --> 00:48:16.530
more on the law side

00:48:16.530 --> 00:48:17.363
is

00:48:18.720 --> 00:48:20.350
forensic analysis.

00:48:20.350 --> 00:48:24.030
If you watch "CSI" or
"Criminal Minds" or anything,

00:48:24.030 --> 00:48:27.540
you might've seen people
looking for DNA samples to see

00:48:27.540 --> 00:48:31.983
